      "date": "2026-05-07T17:16:46.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹4.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹4.00. Ex-date: 30th July 2026 Payment date: 5th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.5%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.9%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (29% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (29% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 10% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 50% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
